  "method": "Calibrated CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID around each I/O batch, subtract the mean of 10000 back-to-back clock pairs. Per-batch preparation, sending for read tests, receiving for write tests and payload verification are outside the CPU timing. Wall time covers the entire loop. Each case creates a fresh nonpersistent TAP in a private network namespace. No concurrent builds or tests.",
  "read_batch": 64,
  "read_modes": "Plain nonblocking read or 64 IORING_OP_READ submissions with RWF_NOWAIT; all completions validated. An empty ring batch must complete with EAGAIN. Process task count checked after timed reads.",
  "write_modes": "Plain write of 64 prebuilt frames, or writev of one VNET_HDR + Ethernet/IPv4/UDP header and 1/2/16/43/44 payload slices. UDP listener without UDP_GRO verifies every delivered payload in order. TUNSETOFFLOAD remains zero.",
  "limits": "Isolated hot-buffer syscall costs, not end-to-end goodput or the production CPU ceiling. Construction/checksum/coalescibility checks excluded from timed writes. UDP payload checks do not prove byte-exact Ethernet/IP reconstruction, partial-tail behavior, IPv6, mixed traffic or all supported kernels.",
